  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;　(注)１．定量的な保有効果は、個別の取引状況等を開示できないため記載が困難であります。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:54pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　２．当行の株式の保有の有無については&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;、銘柄が持株会社の場合はその主要な子会社等の保有分(実質所有株式数)を勘案し記載しております&lt;/span&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row3Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:54pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　３．保有の合理性は、「保有目的の適切性」の確認を行うとともに、「リスク・リターン指標（RORA等）」の基準値を設定し、個社毎に検証を実施しております。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock>
