&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;２．満期保有目的の債券&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当ありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;３．その他有価証券&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;前連結会計年度(&lt;span&gt;2023年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
